    "honest_statement": "In seasonal holdout cross-validation with 7-day buffers, the model demonstrates strongest skill during high-pollution winter periods. For Winter 2024-2025 (mean 58.6 \u00b5g/m\u00b3) and Winter 2025-2026 (mean 57.7 \u00b5g/m\u00b3), the model beats the best baseline across all evaluated horizons (1h, 6h, 12h, 24h, 48h) with 95% block-bootstrap CIs strictly below zero. During clean monsoon conditions (mean 20.0 \u00b5g/m\u00b3), particulate variation is minimal; the model beats persistence at 1h, ties the blended baseline at 6h-24h, and loses to the blended baseline at 48h. Weather features contribute 27.2% of split gain at 6h and 39.3% at 24h, improving MAE by 0.33 to 0.99 \u00b5g/m\u00b3 over lag-only models."
